  "title": "Doc's Best Beef Jerky",
  "description": "An easy, homemade beef jerky marinade, made with soy sauce, liquid smoke, brown sugar, and spices, makes the most flavorful beef jerky ever — maybe even the best you'd ever had!",
  "authors": [
